Figure 10: 
Comparison of the quantities entering Eq. 5.17 for the $\ell=0$ regulated elastic cross section:
exactly on the $n=1$, $\ell=0$ resonance, $\xi=\xi_{1,0}\simeq 0.84$ (top left);
at very small detuning from this resonance, $\xi-\xi_{1,0}=\pm 10^{-4}$ (top right);
at a non-resonant point, $\xi=2$ (bottom left);
and for two values of $\xi$ corresponding to elastic-scattering zeros: the zero-velocity antiresonance,
$\xi_{\cancel{\rm elas}~}^{(\infty)}\simeq 2.23$, and the zero at $\zeta=10^{3}$ (bottom right).
